      "body": [
        {
          "type": "TextualBody",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>(Week of) Torah portion \"Then (Jacob) went up (to him) (Gen. 44:18&ndash;47:31) 1553 (Dec. 1241)</li>\n<li>Collector of mezonot: the precious elder (our) ma(ster)</li>\n<li>Mu\u1e25arraz (may his) e(nd be) g(ood). Collected: 52 dirh(ems)</li>\n<li>Expended: Cost of a qin\u1e6d\u0101r of bread</li>\n<li>31 1/4 dir(hems). Balance:&nbsp;</li>\n<li>21 dirhem(s). Expended:</li>\n<li>for the Nasi [5] Nissim 3</li>\n<li>Yosef the supervisor 3 the elder Hiba the beadle</li>\n<li>3 the teacher //Netanel// 2 the Kohen 2 Munajj\u0101 3</li></ol>\n",
